    {
      "refdes": "U1",
      "kind": "Custom",
      "value": "LM317",
      "pos": [
        116,
        -4
      ],
      "rot": 0,
      "footprint": "TO-220-3",
      "custom": {
        "name": "LM317",
        "prefix": "U",
        "pins": [
          {
            "number": "3",
            "name": "IN",
            "side": "left"
          },
          {
            "number": "2",
            "name": "OUT",
            "side": "right"
          },
          {
            "number": "1",
            "name": "ADJ",
            "side": "bottom"
          }
        ],
        "sim": {
          "kind": "subckt",
          "element": "",
          "name": "LM317",
          "text": ".subckt LM317 in adj out\n* line regulation through a slow path (the data sheet's DC figure) and the ripple from the input (flat, the ripple rejection)\nElf lfa adj in adj 1\nRlf lfa lf 1.59Meg\nClf lf adj 100n\n* output noise (taken as flat over the data sheet's band): a 1 k resistor's noise, scaled\nRnz nz adj 1k\n* the output's difference from part to part (0 V; the variation analyses move it between the data sheet's min and max)\nVtol vt adj DC 0\n* spread Vtol -0.05 0.05 vref (data sheet: 1.2 to 1.3 V)\nBtgt t0 adj V=1.25+5.47073e-05*(V(lf,adj)-6.25)+7.02927e-05*(V(in,adj)-6.25)+V(vt,adj)\nEn tgt t0 nz adj 92.1526\n* the ceiling the input leaves (the dropout)\nBdo ind adj V=V(in,adj)-1.6-0.399161*I(Vs)\n* the target, no higher than the dropout's ceiling\nEx1 xh1 adj tgt ind 1000\nD1 xh1 yh1 DREG\nRy1 yh1 adj 1k\nEy1 y1 adj yh1 adj 0.001\nEc1 c1 adj tgt y1 1\n* the current limit: the current the target asks for (amps as volts), no more than the limit\nBu u adj V=(V(c1,adj)-V(out,adj))/0.000838926\nBlim cl adj V=limit(2.2+-0.072*(V(in,adj)-V(out,adj)-15),0.4,2.2)\nEx2 xh2 adj u cl 1000\nD2 xh2 yh2 DREG\nRy2 yh2 adj 1k\nEy2 y2 adj yh2 adj 0.001\nEc2 uc adj u y2 1\nBc2 c2 adj V=V(out,adj)+0.000838926*V(uc,adj)\n* output through the load regulation's resistance; the output current comes from the input (both ways, as the earlier\n* bundled models did: a dead or reversed input then leaves the output near 0 V)\nEo o adj c2 adj 1\nVs o os DC 0\nRo os out 0.000838926\nBin in adj I=I(Vs)\n* adjustment pin current (out of ADJ)\nIadj in adj DC 5e-05\n.model DREG D(IS=1e-12 N=1)\n.ends LM317",
          "pins": [
            "3",
            "1",
            "2"
          ],
          "params": {
            "dropout": 2.0,
            "vref": 1.25
          },
          "limits": [
            "出力電圧、ドロップアウト (入力が低いと出力が下がる)、出力抵抗、負荷電流が入力電流になることを再現するマクロモデルです。",
            "扱わないもの: リップル除去、負荷や入力が急に変わったときの応答、静止電流、過電流保護、熱による制限。",
            "モデルには内部の応答がないので、入力・出力のコンデンサを付けたときの安定性 (発振しないか) は確かめられません。データシートの推奨回路に従ってください。"
          ]
        },
        "ratings": {
          "v_max": 40.0,
          "i_max": 1.5,
          "rows": [
            {
              "name": "基準電圧",
              "value": "1.25V"
            },
            {
              "name": "入出力電圧差の最小",
              "value": "2V (代表)"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
